WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.890
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.160 --> 01:41.640
[Episode 16]

3
01:41.640 --> 01:47.019
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

4
01:47.019 --> 01:49.719
This military report just came in.

5
01:49.719 --> 01:53.960
The Qi Army has launched a sudden attack on Luanjiang City, held by the Cheng Army.

6
01:53.960 --> 01:57.137
The Cheng Army is urgently requesting our help.

7
01:57.137 --> 02:01.440
But the Qi Army is at its peak now.

8
02:01.440 --> 02:04.510
If we intervene rashly, we'll invite trouble.

9
02:04.510 --> 02:06.019
It's not worth the risk.

10
02:06.019 --> 02:07.360
I agree.

11
02:07.360 --> 02:10.304
We've just recruited many new soldiers.

12
02:10.304 --> 02:12.080
They haven't finished their training yet.

13
02:12.080 --> 02:16.110
Sending an unready army on a long expedition would be far too risky.

14
02:16.110 --> 02:20.006
We should fortify our base and see how things unfold.

15
02:23.280 --> 02:25.720
- Let's wait and see. - Caution is best at a time like this.

16
02:25.720 --> 02:27.937
- Exactly. - Let's wait and see.

17
02:53.600 --> 02:54.900
What is it?

18
02:55.640 --> 02:57.277
Do you have an idea?

19
02:57.277 --> 02:59.904
The Qi Army has deployed tens of thousands of troops.

20
02:59.904 --> 03:04.043
Why go to such great lengths for a mere Luanjiang City?

21
03:04.660 --> 03:06.493
What are you implying?

22
03:07.360 --> 03:11.304
I believe that once the Cheng Army falls,

23
03:11.304 --> 03:16.000
their real target will be our military stronghold in Pingzhou.

24
03:16.000 --> 03:19.443
Pingzhou's rough terrain makes it easy to defend.

25
03:19.443 --> 03:21.680
They wouldn't attack it.

26
03:21.680 --> 03:22.981
Father.

27
03:38.080 --> 03:39.861
Good reminder.

28
03:40.480 --> 03:44.241
I'll send more troops there to prepare for battle.

29
03:45.280 --> 03:46.700
That's all.

30
03:51.440 --> 03:55.259
[Xiangxi Hotel]

31
03:55.259 --> 03:57.289
Then it's settled.

32
03:57.289 --> 03:59.016
- Alright. - Take care.

33
03:59.016 --> 04:00.179
No need to see us out.

34
04:23.420 --> 04:28.199
How does a lady this pretty end up a drunkard?

35
04:36.319 --> 04:39.560
Li, tell me.

36
04:40.253 --> 04:44.912
Is Yu Chang Xuan hiding someone at Maple Mansion?

37
04:50.800 --> 04:52.620
What kind of drunk talk is that?

38
04:52.620 --> 04:54.152
How is that possible?

39
04:54.152 --> 04:56.320
Rui Tong and I go there every day.

40
04:56.320 --> 04:58.800
Chang Xuan is just busy with military affairs.

41
04:58.800 --> 05:00.221
Liar.

42
05:03.000 --> 05:06.080
Then let me drive you there, and you can see for yourself.

43
05:06.080 --> 05:09.604
When we get there, you can search every inch of the place.

44
05:09.604 --> 05:11.673
See if you can find a single soul.

45
05:20.000 --> 05:22.160
That's enough. No more drinking.

46
05:22.160 --> 05:24.524
Men are all alike.

47
05:24.524 --> 05:29.419
Always bullying me.

48
05:33.120 --> 05:34.860
Always.

49
05:35.680 --> 05:39.213
Don't you dare remember how pathetic I look today.

50
05:40.240 --> 05:42.893
I'm basically your sister-in-law.

51
05:57.199 --> 05:58.393
Master Chang Xuan.

52
06:14.040 --> 06:15.199
Master Chang Xuan.

53
06:16.000 --> 06:17.840
How is Miss Ye today?

54
06:17.840 --> 06:19.577
She had a good appetite.

55
06:19.577 --> 06:23.500
I think Miss Ye and you are getting along better and better.

56
06:44.760 --> 06:46.270
You came in so quietly.

57
06:46.270 --> 06:48.013
Why didn't you say something?

58
06:51.920 --> 06:54.206
A poem just came to mind.

59
06:54.206 --> 06:58.090
"The peach tree is young and elegant. Brilliant are its flowers.

60
06:58.090 --> 07:02.586
The lady is going to her future home. And will order well her chamber and house."

61
07:03.880 --> 07:05.560
Nonsense.

62
07:05.560 --> 07:07.279
These aren't even peach blossoms.

63
07:13.640 --> 07:16.000
No flower is as beautiful as you.

64
07:20.060 --> 07:24.459
I passed by Hengyuan Jewelry today and saw a pair of earrings.

65
07:24.459 --> 07:26.060
I thought they'd suit you perfectly.

66
07:34.320 --> 07:36.206
Then put them on for me.

67
08:23.480 --> 08:24.893
Do they look good?

68
08:25.880 --> 08:27.386
Beautiful.

69
08:43.559 --> 08:45.560
Yu Chang Xuan.

70
08:45.560 --> 08:47.964
You promised to give me time.

71
08:47.964 --> 08:49.880
We agreed to take things slow.

72
08:58.400 --> 09:00.633
I'll do whatever you say.

73
09:04.200 --> 09:05.526
Come in.

74
09:07.440 --> 09:09.980
Master Chang Xuan, everything is ready.

75
09:13.680 --> 09:16.026
I've prepared a surprise for you tonight.

76
09:17.960 --> 09:19.200
Okay.

77
10:12.200 --> 10:16.000
Tonight's fireworks are just for you.

78
10:24.840 --> 10:26.206
Thank you.

79
10:34.679 --> 10:38.940
- It's beautiful. - Like flowers. So pretty.

80
10:50.520 --> 10:52.297
Are you cold?

81
10:52.297 --> 10:54.526
I'll have a servant fetch you a blanket.

82
10:55.480 --> 10:59.480
I'm fine. My shawl is in the living room.

83
10:59.480 --> 11:01.040
I'll get it myself.

84
11:01.040 --> 11:03.660
- I'll go with you. - I'll be right back.

85
11:26.000 --> 11:27.960
- It's so beautiful. - It really is.

86
11:27.960 --> 11:29.793
- This one is pretty too. - It's like a dream.

87
11:29.793 --> 11:31.240
- So beautiful. - It is.

88
11:31.240 --> 11:33.740
- There are plenty more. - It's so beautiful.

89
11:33.740 --> 11:34.960
Look!

90
11:50.680 --> 11:53.344
Go check on Miss Ye. Why isn't she back yet?

91
11:53.344 --> 11:54.543
Yes, sir.

92
12:17.520 --> 12:19.113
Master Chang Xuan.

93
12:59.080 --> 13:01.600
The bleeding has stopped. But her body is cold.

94
13:01.600 --> 13:04.586
Monitor her temperature and pulse and document the readings.

95
13:32.040 --> 13:33.773
Yu Chang Xuan.

96
13:35.720 --> 13:37.800
I'll agree to your terms.

97
13:38.920 --> 13:41.606
I must have owed you in a past life.

98
14:17.580 --> 14:20.159
Master Chang Xuan, Miss Ye is awake.

99
14:20.159 --> 14:23.340
But she is very weak right now. She needs rest.

100
15:28.360 --> 15:34.966
So all the wonderful days were just a setup.

101
15:41.440 --> 15:44.800
Just when I had the most hope, you tried to kill yourself.

102
15:48.760 --> 15:51.526
You used that to get back at me.

103
17:02.279 --> 17:03.846
You win.

104
17:35.360 --> 17:36.913
You can leave.

105
17:43.400 --> 17:49.259
Whether you live or die...

106
17:52.380 --> 17:55.286
let's never see each other again.

107
18:06.840 --> 18:08.273
Go.

108
20:00.640 --> 20:02.360
Mr. Ma.

109
20:02.360 --> 20:06.303
Love in this world must be mutual.

110
20:06.303 --> 20:07.703
It cannot be forced.

111
20:08.360 --> 20:12.720
But your appearance has completely disrupted my life.

112
20:12.720 --> 20:15.321
We'd best not cross paths ever again.

113
20:17.000 --> 20:21.616
Yu Chang Xuan, do you have any idea how much I hate you right now?

114
20:21.616 --> 20:23.680
I want you to suffer forever.

115
20:23.680 --> 20:25.700
I wish you'd rot in hell!

116
20:34.240 --> 20:36.006
Yu Chang Xuan.

117
20:37.440 --> 20:39.400
I'll agree to your terms.

118
20:40.920 --> 20:43.840
I must have owed you in a past life.

119
21:46.200 --> 21:47.559
Go.

120
22:54.140 --> 22:56.279
Tanghulu for sale!

121
22:56.279 --> 23:00.319
Sweet and delicious Tanghulu!

122
23:01.579 --> 23:03.539
Mom, slow down.

123
23:08.400 --> 23:11.080
The doctor said you just had surgery.

124
23:11.080 --> 23:13.180
You need rest to recover.

125
23:13.760 --> 23:15.400
Look who's talking.

126
23:15.400 --> 23:20.140
You're so pale, with no color in your cheeks.

127
23:22.320 --> 23:23.760
I'm fine.

128
23:23.760 --> 23:27.120
I just caught a bit of a cold a few days ago.

129
23:28.680 --> 23:33.000
Xue Ting's sentence was reduced thanks to Han Zhi.

130
23:33.000 --> 23:38.599
Shouldn't we prepare a gift and thank her in person?

131
23:38.599 --> 23:39.720
No need.

132
23:45.559 --> 23:47.905
I mean...

133
23:47.905 --> 23:51.740
Han Zhi is busy preparing for her graduation exams.

134
23:51.740 --> 23:56.700
When she's available, I'll thank her properly.

135
24:09.400 --> 24:13.063
I just hope Xue Ting can come home soon.

136
24:13.063 --> 24:16.462
So our family can finally be reunited.

137
24:18.280 --> 24:21.520
Mom, let me help you back inside.

138
24:24.220 --> 24:26.793
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

139
24:26.793 --> 24:29.600
The Qi Army has taken the Cheng Army's territory.

140
24:29.600 --> 24:32.933
Its vanguard is now advancing along the valley rapidly towards Pingzhou.

141
24:32.933 --> 24:34.700
Chang Xuan saw this coming.

142
24:34.700 --> 24:37.940
His prediction was spot-on.

143
24:39.200 --> 24:41.640
Where is the 7th Brigade stationed?

144
24:41.640 --> 24:45.003
As you ordered, they've built fortifications on the front line.

145
24:45.003 --> 24:48.480
We must drive the Qi Army back to Luanjiang City.

146
24:51.380 --> 24:56.440
Commander-in-Chief, please allow me to lead the troops into battle at Luanjiang City.

147
25:07.880 --> 25:09.000
Chang Xuan.

148
25:09.000 --> 25:14.240
You lack the experience to command on your own.

149
25:15.480 --> 25:19.360
Then let Uncle Zhang come with me. He'll oversee and guide the operation.

150
25:19.360 --> 25:22.273
Also, the Nanhuai Arsenal's new weapons are already in mass production.

151
25:23.166 --> 25:25.566
The first batch is nearly ready.

152
25:26.360 --> 25:31.680
With these weapons, we'll surely win this battle.

153
25:31.680 --> 25:34.619
Commander-in-Chief, please give me this chance.

154
25:40.080 --> 25:41.480
Alright.

155
25:41.480 --> 25:45.960
I'll have Uncle Zhang and your brother-in-law go with you.

156
25:45.960 --> 25:49.819
You must win this battle.

157
25:50.480 --> 25:52.520
Failure is not an option.

158
25:52.520 --> 25:55.999
Yes, sir! I won't let you down, Commander-in-Chief.

159
26:01.660 --> 26:04.766
Shouldn't you reconsider going to Luanjiang City?

160
26:06.080 --> 26:08.004
Hey, don't be so hasty.

161
26:08.004 --> 26:09.761
I know you're hurting.

162
26:09.761 --> 26:11.299
But don't put yourself in danger.

163
26:11.299 --> 26:13.700
I've already decided. That's it.

164
26:13.700 --> 26:15.180
Is this because of Ye Ping Jun?

165
26:15.180 --> 26:16.520
Don't mention her name again.

166
26:16.520 --> 26:18.184
She has nothing to do with me.

167
26:18.184 --> 26:20.339
What do you mean by "nothing"?

168
26:20.339 --> 26:21.500
You--

169
26:23.200 --> 26:25.779
Chang Xuan, think about it again.

170
26:25.779 --> 26:26.799
This...

171
26:29.720 --> 26:31.246
See that?

172
26:32.880 --> 26:34.404
He's still acting tough.

173
26:34.404 --> 26:37.700
Ye Ping Jun must have broken him. That's why he's like this.

174
26:37.700 --> 26:39.799
Don't presume to know him.

175
26:40.840 --> 26:43.962
We both know he's been waiting for a chance to prove himself.

176
26:43.962 --> 26:45.749
Yes, that's part of it.

177
26:45.749 --> 26:46.880
I'm not finished yet.

178
26:46.880 --> 26:48.522
Rui Tong, let me tell you.

179
26:48.522 --> 26:52.937
Nothing escapes my eyes. You hear me?

180
26:52.937 --> 26:55.280
Keep an eye on him. You...

181
26:55.280 --> 26:56.960
By the time you act, it'll be too late.

182
26:56.960 --> 26:58.939
What's wrong with you people?

183
27:00.400 --> 27:02.440
[Yu's Mansion]

184
27:02.440 --> 27:03.633
This one, too.

185
27:04.640 --> 27:06.299
Bring another box.

186
27:06.299 --> 27:10.240
Salvia, goji berries, deer antlers, and bird's nest.

187
27:10.240 --> 27:14.280
If I don't pack these now, you won't find any in that godforsaken place.

188
27:14.280 --> 27:16.178
These are fine things.

189
27:16.178 --> 27:17.856
And this one.

190
27:17.856 --> 27:20.900
I almost forgot. Go find two chefs.

191
27:20.900 --> 27:22.273
He doesn't know how to cook.

192
27:22.273 --> 27:24.279
- Okay. - Go ahead.

193
27:26.180 --> 27:27.326
Why?

194
27:27.326 --> 27:29.640
There's no need, Bao Ru.

195
27:29.640 --> 27:30.760
Mom.

196
27:30.760 --> 27:33.740
Ginseng, deer antlers, crabs, shrimp, and rose dew.

197
27:33.740 --> 27:34.799
Have you packed them all?

198
27:34.799 --> 27:36.120
Yes, I have.

199
27:36.120 --> 27:38.700
And the maids and servants in this house.

200
27:38.700 --> 27:40.740
Pack them all into that box for Chang Xuan.

201
27:40.740 --> 27:42.640
Don't you worry. I've thought of everything.

202
27:42.640 --> 27:45.480
It's best to pack Father's whip too.

203
27:45.480 --> 27:47.180
It might remind him to behave.

204
27:47.180 --> 27:48.680
Are you quite finished?

205
27:48.680 --> 27:51.680
Bao Ru, that's enough.

206
27:51.680 --> 27:55.497
He's going to war, not running a business.

207
27:55.497 --> 27:58.440
- How's he supposed to manage all that stuff? - Exactly.

208
27:58.440 --> 28:01.339
What's wrong with caring for my son?

209
28:01.339 --> 28:03.000
This all happened so suddenly.

210
28:03.000 --> 28:04.500
I haven't had time to prepare.

211
28:04.500 --> 28:08.220
My mind is all over the place, and I can't stop worrying.

212
28:09.400 --> 28:13.720
Didn't I arrange for Zhang Xiao Xian and Bing Wen to accompany him?

213
28:13.720 --> 28:17.000
Usually, he gets credit for others' hard work.

214
28:17.000 --> 28:19.644
But true gold must be refined by fire.

215
28:19.644 --> 28:22.526
This is an opportunity he fought for himself.

216
28:22.526 --> 28:24.080
Let him gain some experience.

217
28:24.080 --> 28:26.380
I'm still worried.

218
28:26.380 --> 28:30.480
Father already said he has a strategist and a brigade commander with him.

219
28:30.480 --> 28:33.030
He's a grown man. What could go wrong?

220
28:33.030 --> 28:35.480
I think he needs some real battle experience.

221
28:35.480 --> 28:36.579
A few hits won't hurt.

222
28:36.579 --> 28:38.240
Look at Xiao Bei Chen from Jiangbei.

223
28:38.240 --> 28:41.160
Only a year or two older, yet he's already a legendary soldier--

224
28:41.160 --> 28:42.840
Yu Qi Xuan.

225
28:42.840 --> 28:46.637
You sure get excited when talking about someone else's brother, huh?

226
28:46.637 --> 28:48.440
You think he's better than yours?

227
28:48.440 --> 28:50.200
Then go ask him to be your brother.

228
28:50.200 --> 28:51.880
If you look down on your brother, get out.

229
28:51.880 --> 28:53.839
Out! Don't take up space here.

230
28:53.839 --> 28:55.106
- That's enough. - This list--

231
28:55.106 --> 28:57.200
It's not that she looks down on her brother.

232
28:57.200 --> 28:58.480
Exactly.

233
28:58.480 --> 29:01.240
[Pillar of the North: Xiao Bei Chen] Is this the Xiao Bei Chen you mentioned?

234
29:01.240 --> 29:03.659
Yes. Thank you, Father.

235
29:03.659 --> 29:05.579
You, check this against the list.

236
29:12.520 --> 29:14.321
Why are you looking for me?

237
29:16.960 --> 29:18.520
Miss Ye.

238
29:18.520 --> 29:23.440
Did you know Chang Xuan is heading off to fight at Luanjiang City the day after tomorrow?

239
29:27.560 --> 29:28.680
That's none of my concern.

240
29:28.680 --> 29:30.350
None of your concern?

241
29:30.350 --> 29:32.560
Chang Xuan got your Jiang Xue Ting out safely.

242
29:32.560 --> 29:35.280
And you don't care what happens to him, huh?

243
29:35.280 --> 29:37.653
He's the one who forced everything.

244
29:37.653 --> 29:39.759
Now you expect me to care about him.

245
29:39.759 --> 29:41.549
How does that make sense?

246
29:41.549 --> 29:42.709
Fine.

247
29:42.709 --> 29:45.420
You can blame him or resent him all you want.

248
29:45.420 --> 29:47.520
But let me tell you this.

249
29:47.520 --> 29:49.440
Jiang Xue Ting was a spy in the Yu Army.

250
29:49.440 --> 29:52.480
Surely Chang Xuan didn't force him to do that, did he?

251
29:52.480 --> 29:55.104
Given his crimes, he should have been executed.

252
29:55.104 --> 29:56.639
Why is he walking free?

253
29:58.280 --> 30:02.120
Because Chang Xuan begged the Commander-in-Chief, all for you.

254
30:02.120 --> 30:05.320
He knelt all night through the wind and pouring rain.

255
30:06.880 --> 30:09.960
And another thing, about your mother's surgery.

256
30:09.960 --> 30:14.320
You didn't really think the hospital did its best out of some kindness, did you?

257
30:14.320 --> 30:15.935
It was Chang Xuan.

258
30:15.935 --> 30:20.360
He drove to Jinping overnight to keep the specialist who could do the surgery.

259
30:20.360 --> 30:24.157
He crashed on the way and got hurt, but didn't even stop to get treated.

260
30:24.157 --> 30:28.200
When the surgery was over, he rushed back to tell you the good news.

261
30:28.960 --> 30:30.800
And how did you treat him?

262
30:32.800 --> 30:37.400
That knife of yours almost stabbed him right in the heart.

263
30:48.360 --> 30:51.480
I... didn't know any of this.

264
30:59.520 --> 31:03.000
That's because he never wanted you to know how much he did for you.

265
31:06.599 --> 31:09.080
Yes, he used to be quite a jerk.

266
31:09.080 --> 31:12.257
He said many hurtful things to you and forced you to stay by his side.

267
31:12.257 --> 31:13.620
But that's because...

268
31:15.733 --> 31:18.974
he never knew how to love someone properly.

269
31:21.480 --> 31:22.779
Miss Ye.

270
31:23.360 --> 31:26.880
I came here today to tell you all this,

271
31:26.880 --> 31:30.880
not to make you feel sorry for him, nor to beg you to like him.

272
31:30.880 --> 31:33.360
How you feel for him is between the two of you.

273
31:35.280 --> 31:37.880
But he's done so much for you

274
31:40.000 --> 31:41.920
and you had no idea.

275
31:43.720 --> 31:45.573
It's not fair to him.

276
31:46.800 --> 31:48.360
Or to you.

277
32:25.400 --> 32:27.079
A telegram from "Blacksmith."

278
32:27.079 --> 32:31.240
It's confirmed that Yu Chang Xuan will lead the Yu Army to Luanjiang City.

279
32:31.240 --> 32:34.260
Kuang Bing Wen will be his deputy, and Zhang Xiao Xian his advisor.

280
32:35.000 --> 32:39.698
Old Devil Yu finally lets his precious son face real battle.

281
32:39.698 --> 32:42.790
He used to have his son pampered.

282
32:42.790 --> 32:46.090
But on the battlefield, bullets have no eyes.

283
32:47.240 --> 32:53.960
Whether emperor or commoner, everyone only has one life.

284
32:53.960 --> 32:58.980
Commander, this is a golden opportunity to get rid of Yu Chang Xuan.

285
32:59.840 --> 33:02.160
We don't even need to lift a finger.

286
33:02.160 --> 33:04.526
Someone else will do it for us.

287
33:04.526 --> 33:09.920
Let's sit tight and wait for the good news.

288
33:20.320 --> 33:22.813
[Commander]

289
33:32.440 --> 33:34.242
It was Chang Xuan.

290
33:34.242 --> 33:38.520
He drove to Jinping overnight to keep the specialist who could do the surgery.

291
33:38.520 --> 33:42.440
He crashed on the way and got hurt, but didn't even stop to get treated.

292
33:42.440 --> 33:43.841
And how did you treat him?

293
33:44.539 --> 33:48.460
That knife of yours almost stabbed him right in the heart.

294
33:50.880 --> 33:53.337
He's had you in his heart for a long time.

295
33:53.337 --> 33:56.519
He said many hurtful things to you and forced you to stay by his side.

296
33:56.519 --> 33:57.859
But that's because...

297
33:58.640 --> 34:02.006
he never knew how to love someone properly.

298
34:54.840 --> 34:57.380
Excuse me. Please, let me through.

299
36:29.119 --> 36:33.689
- Woof. - Woof.

300
36:33.689 --> 36:36.160
- Woof. - Woof.

301
36:36.160 --> 36:38.806
- Woof. - Woof.

302
36:40.560 --> 36:43.560
- Woof. - Louder.

303
36:43.560 --> 36:46.139
- Don't you know how to bark? - Woof.

304
36:46.139 --> 36:47.520
- Woof. - That sounds terrible.

305
36:47.520 --> 36:49.237
- Woof. - Woof.

306
36:49.237 --> 36:50.360
[Zhao Cheng Hai]

307
36:50.360 --> 36:52.160
[Deputy Regimental Commander, 9th Army Corps] Who didn't make a sound?

308
36:52.160 --> 36:53.340
Woof.

309
36:56.940 --> 36:58.226
Get them.

310
36:59.240 --> 37:01.280
Still won't bark?

311
37:01.280 --> 37:02.600
I'll teach you a lesson.

312
37:02.600 --> 37:05.972
You little brat. Trying to be a hero, are you?

313
37:05.972 --> 37:06.972
Give it to me.

314
37:08.579 --> 37:10.440
- A hero, huh? - Don't!

315
37:10.440 --> 37:11.460
- A hero, huh? - Stop!

316
37:11.460 --> 37:13.000
Get lost!

317
37:13.000 --> 37:14.480
Still won't bark?

318
37:14.480 --> 37:18.099
Deputy Regimental Commander, if you keep going, you'll kill them.

319
37:18.099 --> 37:19.600
So what if someone dies?

320
37:19.600 --> 37:22.004
Don't I always take the fall for you guys?

321
37:22.004 --> 37:24.805
Beat them to death. Now!

322
37:31.480 --> 37:33.280
Hit them harder!

323
37:38.800 --> 37:40.193
Enough.

324
37:47.880 --> 37:52.160
If you want to learn how to be a man, you must first learn how to be a dog.

325
37:52.160 --> 37:53.461
Understand?

326
37:54.560 --> 37:57.679
I think those ears of yours are of no use.

327
37:57.679 --> 37:59.940
There's no point in keeping them.

328
38:10.120 --> 38:11.960
Do you dare to shoot?

329
38:11.960 --> 38:13.760
Do you have the guts, you dog?

330
38:13.760 --> 38:16.699
I'm a dead man either way.

331
38:16.699 --> 38:17.800
I'm taking you with me.

332
38:17.800 --> 38:19.200
Stop!

333
38:24.840 --> 38:26.413
Put down your guns.

334
38:27.033 --> 38:28.039
Put them down!

335
38:28.039 --> 38:30.699
Put them down, now. Come on.

336
38:33.360 --> 38:34.957
Corps Commander.

337
38:34.957 --> 38:37.639
The telegram said you were still two or three days away.

338
38:37.639 --> 38:39.760
I didn't expect you to get here so soon.

339
38:39.760 --> 38:43.000
If I hadn't arrived early, how could I have seen all this?

340
38:44.760 --> 38:49.080
From the looks of it, you really did live up to my expectations.

341
38:49.080 --> 38:51.277
Corps Commander, I...

342
38:51.277 --> 38:54.360
I had good reason to punish these soldiers.

343
38:54.360 --> 38:56.270
They were caught brawling.

344
38:56.270 --> 38:58.440
Look, they're all bleeding.

345
38:58.440 --> 39:02.600
If word gets out, we'll be accused of lax discipline, and morale will collapse.

346
39:02.600 --> 39:04.720
It would tarnish the Yu Army's reputation.

347
39:04.720 --> 39:07.390
So I was just punishing them as a warning.

348
39:07.390 --> 39:09.239
That's not true, Corps Commander.

349
39:09.239 --> 39:11.239
It's his orderly, Ma Liu.

350
39:11.239 --> 39:13.880
He keeps pocketing my pay and calls it a "tribute."

351
39:13.880 --> 39:16.853
When I refuse, he finds ways to torture me.

352
39:16.853 --> 39:18.840
We were truly driven to desperation.

353
39:18.840 --> 39:21.279
You brat! You're lying!

354
39:24.239 --> 39:25.719
I'm still here.

355
39:27.240 --> 39:28.604
Are you going to make the call for me?

356
39:28.604 --> 39:30.539
I wouldn't dare.

357
39:38.720 --> 39:41.500
- Arrest Zhao Cheng Hai! - Yes, sir!

358
39:42.200 --> 39:44.800
Corps Commander, why?

359
39:44.800 --> 39:47.977
I have confirmed that Deputy Regimental Commander Zhao Cheng Hai

360
39:47.977 --> 39:53.000
has long neglected his duties and made a habit of bullying his men.

361
39:53.000 --> 39:54.677
His crimes are numerous.

362
39:54.677 --> 39:57.400
We now have both witnesses and evidence.

363
39:57.400 --> 39:59.326
What else do you have to say?

364
40:00.640 --> 40:03.401
Corps Commander, is that all?

365
40:04.240 --> 40:05.500
I plead guilty.

366
40:05.500 --> 40:08.560
So tell me, what's my punishment? A fine?

367
40:08.560 --> 40:12.084
The guns and ammunition my uncle donated could equip an entire regiment.

368
40:12.084 --> 40:14.837
And I'm only a mere Deputy Regimental Commander.

369
40:14.837 --> 40:18.206
I've put up with it all. Did I ever complain?

370
40:19.240 --> 40:22.633
Since you've confessed, you'll be shot at once.

371
40:28.940 --> 40:30.820
Shot? No way.

372
40:30.820 --> 40:32.880
Even the Corps Commander has to show some respect.

373
40:32.880 --> 40:34.079
He's just trying to scare him.

374
40:34.079 --> 40:35.539
He won't actually kill him.

375
40:37.440 --> 40:41.200
Corps Commander, you'd shoot me?

376
40:41.200 --> 40:43.637
Do you know who my uncle is?

377
40:43.637 --> 40:46.440
The Yu Army's food, its uniforms, and its bullets...

378
40:46.440 --> 40:49.204
All of them were paid by the Zhao family.

379
40:49.204 --> 40:51.320
I just bullied a few low-ranking soldiers.

380
40:51.320 --> 40:53.284
And you're going to shoot me?

381
40:53.284 --> 40:56.100
What about all that money my family put in?

382
40:57.080 --> 40:58.080
Chang Xuan.

383
40:58.080 --> 41:01.880
The Zhao family provides our army with massive funds and supplies every year.

384
41:01.880 --> 41:04.760
His uncle is a titan in the business world.

385
41:04.760 --> 41:07.400
And he has connections with the central government.

386
41:07.400 --> 41:08.800
It's fine, Bing Wen.

387
41:09.720 --> 41:13.780
I know exactly who he's connected to.

388
41:18.960 --> 41:20.524
Yu Chang Xuan!

389
41:20.524 --> 41:22.059
Yu Chang Xuan, you can't kill me!

390
41:22.059 --> 41:24.119
Wait! Wait a moment!

391
41:26.400 --> 41:27.666
Chang Xuan.

392
41:29.280 --> 41:30.900
The Commander-in-Chief is on the phone.

393
41:30.900 --> 41:32.900
He wants this man sent back to Nanhuai.

394
41:32.900 --> 41:34.659
He'll interrogate him himself.

395
41:34.659 --> 41:37.539
I knew no one could touch Deputy Regimental Commander Zhao.

396
41:37.539 --> 41:40.800
They can't. Things will go back to how they were.

397
41:53.040 --> 41:54.680
Shoot him first!

398
41:54.680 --> 41:56.280
- Then I'll take the call. - Yes, sir!

399
41:56.280 --> 41:58.000
- Yu Chang Xuan! - Chang Xuan.

400
41:58.960 --> 42:00.940
You... let go of me!

401
42:00.940 --> 42:03.040
Yu Chang Xuan, you can't kill me!

402
42:03.040 --> 42:04.840
Yu Chang Xuan!

403
42:04.840 --> 42:06.233
Let go!

404
42:07.000 --> 42:08.313
Get off me!

405
42:10.599 --> 42:13.400
- The Corps Commander really shot him. - He actually shot him.

406
42:13.400 --> 42:15.579
How will he explain this to the Commander-in-Chief?

407
42:29.380 --> 42:34.900
In the Yu Army, bullying soldiers is the whole army's disgrace.

408
42:35.480 --> 42:37.940
Moreover, it is my failure in duty.

409
42:38.760 --> 42:43.160
Starting today, those days are over.

410
42:43.840 --> 42:47.050
Under my command, military rules will be enforced.

411
42:47.050 --> 42:49.320
Rewards and punishments will be clear.

412
42:49.320 --> 42:54.017
Regardless of your background or your rank,

413
42:54.017 --> 42:58.198
the loyal and brave who earn merit

414
42:59.199 --> 43:00.699
will be handsomely rewarded.

415
43:02.400 --> 43:03.973
Conversely...

416
43:05.480 --> 43:09.879
those who deceive their superiors or harm their comrades

417
43:09.879 --> 43:13.320
will be executed without mercy like this man!

418
43:13.320 --> 43:15.886
- Great! - Well said!
